  "question": {
    "text": "Consider the statement: &quot;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>n</mi></mfenced><mo>:</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>41</mn></math> is prime&quot;. Then which one of the following is true?"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>3</mn></mfenced></math> is false but <math><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> is true",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Both <math><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> are false",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Both <math><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> are true",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> is false but <math><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> is true",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>n</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>41</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>41</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>47</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>5</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>41</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>61</mn></math></p><p>Hence <math><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> both are prime.</p><p>Hence, both are true.</p>"
  }
